FOUR INACCURACIES IN THE PASTED PLAN
  a) Repository name: -Uncensored-GGUF -> actual -Uncensored-Quantized.
  b) Model size: Q4_K_M is 4.29 GB, not 4.60 GB. More importantly the plan omits the components that
     are mandatory alongside it:
        qwen-image-2.1-UC-Q4_K_M.gguf          4.29 GB
        text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_w4a8...       5.88 GB  (INSTALL.md lists it; int8_convrot is 8.71 GB)
        vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16...         0.63 GB
        -------------------------------------------------
        realistic total                     ~10.8 GB  (not 4.6)
  c) ComfyUI-GGUF node: the light tier requires it ("否则出图会被 ComfyUI 直接拒收" per INSTALL.md).
     The plan never mentions it.
  d) The XPU environment: the plan says torch.xpu is needed but does not say that this machine does not
     have it. Measured: torch 2.14.1+**cpu**, torch.xpu.is_available() = False, no intel_extension_for_pytorch
     installed, no gguf package. ComfyUI is not installed anywhere either.

